 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/10/08 16:12| 02 | 307| 124| 0428| 0045| 0329| 0530|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/10/07 14:24| 02 | 325| 084| 0284| 0024| 0220| 0336|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/10/07 14:24| 01 | 255| 024| 0224| 0017| 0194| 0252|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/10/06 22:00| 02 | 071| 008| 0122| 0046| 0103| 0208|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/10/06 20:36| 02 | 039| 016| 0201| 0046| 0168| 0306|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/10/06 20:24| 01 | 303| 012| 033"
